  "adaptations": [
    "Fixed 60 Hz match time and strict elapsed >450 ticks; rotation commits outside object callbacks.",
    "Shared bounded CLI and 50-map cycle; original Frags/25 default with host 15 versus dedicated 10 minutes. Frag limit capped at current wire score bound.",
    "One ServerSession/GameSession; original player cleanup and fresh-world initialization; failed destination terminates instead of resuming partial state.",
    "Protocol 16 LevelChanging; ENet peer/profile retained while public player aliases and world/object identities restart. Ready/baseline admission repeats.",
    "Source end notice/bell, scores/third person/zoom/items reset, neutral input and CancelFiringState SOUNDSTOP; independent authoritative action gating.",
    "Owned client geometry/replica/audio/clock reset, retired cross-channel packet filtering, no GPU or pointers on wire.",
    "Existing solo, source RNG/logical audio, CMoveMgr integration and PBR remain unchanged; Team/CTF admission remains pending."
  ]
